  prefab: {fileID: 919132149155446097, guid: 897bc4e57829cec4b92efb6eeefe2b6c, type: 3}
  robotName: Spider
  robotDescription: 'Empty Conductor Form:

    In this form, the player can issue
    commands to other robots.


    Spider Form:

    In this form, the player can
    perform basic actions such as fighting and digging, but loses control of the
    swarm. If you lose the swarm, you are forced to use this form.'
  robotSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8d296e8ac5104e44aa5b45c611814917, type: 3}
  abilityDescription: "Empty Conductor Form:\n- Disconnect (active) [E]\nThe spider
    jumps off the Conductor\u2019s head, losing control of the puppet\u2019s body
    and focusing all control on the spider.\n\nSpider Form:\n- Connect (active) [E]\nJumps
    onto the conductor\u2019s head, regaining control over him and the entire swarm."
